{"seq":2,"slug":"elliptic-curve","title":"椭圆曲线密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/elliptic-curve","wordCount":1526,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"椭圆曲线密码\">椭圆曲线密码</h1><p>同样是 128 位的安全强度，RSA 需要 3072 位的密钥，椭圆曲线只需要 256 位——短了一个数量级。这一悬殊差距让 ECC 在带宽紧张的移动网络、存储受限的物联网设备、以及追求握手速度的 TLS 里全面取代了 RSA。你手机上的 Signal、电脑里的 SSH 密钥、比特币的钱包地址，背后跑的几乎都是椭圆曲线。它把 RSA 那套「公私钥配对」的思想搬到了一个全然不同的数学舞台——曲线上的点加法群，从而用更小的密钥换来同等乃至更强的安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>椭圆曲线密码的安全根基不是大整数分解，而是椭圆曲线离散对数难题（ECDLP）。在一条定义于有限域上的椭圆曲线上，点与点之间定义了一种特殊的「加法」，由此可以计算「一个基点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 自加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次」得到点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = kG</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。正向计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 很快（用倍点法只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 步），但反过来，只给你 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 想求出标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，目前没有比指数级更快的经典算法。私钥就是那个秘密标量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，公钥就是点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=kG</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[选定曲线参数&lt;br/&gt;有限域 + 基点 G] --&gt; B[随机私钥标量 k]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;公钥 Q = kG&lt;br/&gt;标量乘法 易算&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[公开 Q]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;攻击者: 由 Q,G 求 k&lt;br/&gt;ECDLP 极难&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F[签名 / 密钥交换用 k]&#10;  D --&gt; G[他人用 Q 验签 / 协商]\">flowchart TD\n  A[选定曲线参数&lt;br/&gt;有限域 + 基点 G] --&gt; B[随机私钥标量 k]\n  B --&gt; C[\"公钥 Q = kG&lt;br/&gt;标量乘法 易算\"]\n  C --&gt; D[公开 Q]\n  D --&gt; E[\"攻击者: 由 Q,G 求 k&lt;br/&gt;ECDLP 极难\"]\n  B --&gt; F[签名 / 密钥交换用 k]\n  D --&gt; G[他人用 Q 验签 / 协商]</pre><p>ECC 与 RSA 解决的是同一类问题（公钥加密、签名、密钥交换），但代价天差地别。下表是同等安全强度下的密钥规模对比，正是这张表解释了行业为何集体倒向 ECC：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全强度（位）</th>\n<th>RSA 密钥长度</th>\n<th>ECC 密钥长度</th>\n<th>对称等价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>224</td>\n<td>3DES</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>128</td>\n<td>3072</td>\n<td>256（Curve25519/P-256）</td>\n<td>AES-128</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>192</td>\n<td>7680</td>\n<td>384（P-384）</td>\n<td>AES-192</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>256</td>\n<td>15360</td>\n<td>512（P-521）</td>\n<td>AES-256</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可以看到，要达到 AES-256 级别，RSA 密钥要膨胀到 15360 位（运算慢到不可用），而 ECC 只需 512 位。密钥越短，握手越快、证书越小、移动设备越省电——这就是 ECC 的决定性优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"曲线上的加法群-ecc-的数学直觉\">曲线上的加法群：ECC 的数学直觉</h2><p>椭圆曲线在密码学里常写成 Weierstrass 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2 = x^3 + ax + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，定义在一个大素数域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">F</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{F}_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.975em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上。曲线上的点构成一个交换群，其「加法」有清晰的几何含义：要计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P+Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 两点作一条直线，它必与曲线交于第三点，将该点关于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 轴对称即得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P+Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>。点加自身（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P+P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>）则用该点的切线。群里有一个特殊的「无穷远点」充当单位元，扮演着加法里 0 的角色。</p>\n<p>把这个加法重复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次就是标量乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">kG</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，它是 ECC 一切运算的核心原语。实现上用「倍加法」（double-and-add）：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 按二进制展开，遇 1 做加法、每位做倍点，从而在对数级步数内完成。但朴素的倍加法会因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的比特模式不同而耗时不同，泄露私钥比特——所以安全实现必须用恒定时间的标量乘法（如 Montgomery ladder），这类侧信道防护的工程细节见 <a href=\"../frontier/crypto-engineering-misuse\">密码工程与误用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"curve25519-与-ed25519-现代曲线的胜利\">Curve25519 与 Ed25519：现代曲线的胜利</h2><p>早期标准化的 NIST 曲线（P-256、P-384）因参数来源不够透明而招致信任疑虑，且实现上容易写出有侧信道漏洞的代码。Daniel Bernstein 设计的 Curve25519 改变了局面：它采用 Montgomery 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>486662</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^2 = x^3 + 486662x^2 + x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">486662</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，定义在素数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>255</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{255}-19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">255</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span></span></span> 域上（名字由此而来），所有参数选择都有公开可验证的理由（nothing-up-my-sleeve），且天然支持恒定时间、抗错误输入的高速实现。</p>\n<p>Curve25519 主要用于密钥交换，对应的接口叫 X25519；它的「孪生兄弟」Ed25519 则把同一族曲线（等价的 Edwards 形式）用于数字签名，是 EdDSA 签名方案的旗舰实例。如今 TLS 1.3 明确推荐 X25519、Ed25519，NIST 也在 SP 800-186 更新中正式接纳了 Curve25519（<a href=\"https://getacert.com/learn/key-types-explained\">RSA vs ECC 选择指南</a>）。实践共识非常清晰：新的 SSH 密钥用 Ed25519，新的 TLS 服务器用 ECDSA P-256 或 Ed25519。X25519 用于密钥交换、Ed25519 用于签名的具体协议机制，在 <a href=\"key-exchange-signatures\">密钥交换与数字签名</a> 中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ecc-的量子困境与混合过渡\">ECC 的量子困境与混合过渡</h2><p>ECC 用更短的密钥赢得了经典时代，却在量子时代输得更彻底。Shor 算法不仅能分解整数，也能求解离散对数，对椭圆曲线同样致命——而且如前所述，攻破 P-256 的 ECDLP 所需的量子资源甚至略多于攻破 RSA-2048，但二者都将在足够强的量子计算机面前崩溃（<a href=\"https://postquantum.com/post-quantum/shor-rsa-ecc-diffie-hellman/\">Shor 对 RSA/ECC 的影响</a>）。这意味着 ECC 与 RSA 同属「将被淘汰」的经典公钥阵营，区别只在密钥效率。</p>\n<p>因此 2026 年的过渡策略不是用 ECC 替 RSA，而是用「混合」方案给 ECC 加一层量子保险：把 X25519 与后量子 KEM（ML-KEM-768）拼在一起，会话密钥同时依赖两者，任一被破都不致失守。这正是当前主流浏览器默认的 X25519MLKEM768，详见 <a href=\"../frontier/post-quantum\">后量子密码</a> 与 <a href=\"../protocols/tls-secure-comm\">TLS 与安全通信</a>。在这个混合时代，ECC 不是被废弃，而是作为「经典那一半」继续提供针对当下经典攻击者的坚实保护。</p>\n<p>曲线与签名方案的选型可归纳如下，正是现代实践的默认组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线 / 方案</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n<th>参数来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Curve25519</td>\n<td>Montgomery</td>\n<td>密钥交换</td>\n<td>透明（可验证理由）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ed25519</td>\n<td>Edwards（等价）</td>\n<td>数字签名</td>\n<td>透明（可验证理由）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P-256 / P-384</td>\n<td>Weierstrass</td>\n<td>通用（合规）</td>\n<td>NIST 标准参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ECC 的安全根基是椭圆曲线离散对数难题（ECDLP）：标量乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=kG</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 易算，反求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 极难。</li>\n<li>同等安全强度下 ECC 密钥比 RSA 短一个数量级（128 位强度只需 256 位 vs 3072 位），故全面用于移动、IoT、TLS。</li>\n<li>曲线上点构成加法群，标量乘法是核心原语，安全实现须用 Montgomery ladder 等恒定时间算法防侧信道。</li>\n<li>Curve25519/Ed25519 以透明参数和高速恒定时间实现胜出：X25519 做密钥交换、Ed25519 做签名，已成现代默认。</li>\n<li>ECC 与 RSA 同样败于 Shor 算法，2026 年的过渡是 X25519 与 ML-KEM 的混合方案，而非用 ECC 取代 RSA。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"椭圆曲线密码","id":"椭圆曲线密码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"曲线上的加法群：ECC 的数学直觉","id":"曲线上的加法群-ecc-的数学直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"Curve25519 与 Ed25519：现代曲线的胜利","id":"curve25519-与-ed25519-现代曲线的胜利"},{"level":2,"text":"ECC 的量子困境与混合过渡","id":"ecc-的量子困境与混合过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"公钥原理与 RSA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/rsa-public-key"},"next":{"title":"密钥交换与数字签名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/key-exchange-signatures"}}